{"v":15,"id":"a06","kid":"alex","title":"In the Park","zh":"在公园里","level":"2","genre":"公园","src":"original","sum":"每天傍晚和爷爷去家附近的公园：湖里有鸭子，有人放风筝、遛狗、跳舞，小作者最喜欢滑梯。","words":93,"paras":[{"t":"There is a big park near my home. I go there with my grandpa every evening.","w":[[0,5,"there",-1],[6,8,"is",-1],[9,10,"a",-1],[11,14,"big",-1],[15,19,"park",-1],[20,24,"near",-1],[25,27,"my",-1],[28,32,"home",-1],[34,35,"i",-1],[36,38,"go",-1],[39,44,"there",-1],[45,49,"with",-1],[50,52,"my",-1],[53,60,"grandpa",-1],[61,66,"every",-1],[67,74,"evening",-1]]},{"t":"The park has tall trees and pretty flowers. There is a small lake, too. Ducks swim in the lake. I give them some bread.","w":[[0,3,"the",-1],[4,8,"park",-1],[9,12,"has",-1],[13,17,"tall",-1],[18,23,"trees",-1],[24,27,"and",-1],[28,34,"pretty",-1],[35,42,"flowers",-1],[44,49,"there",-1],[50,52,"is",-1],[53,54,"a",-1],[55,60,"small",-1],[61,65,"lake",-1],[67,70,"too",-1],[72,77,"ducks",-1],[78,82,"swim",-1],[83,85,"in",-1],[86,89,"the",-1],[90,94,"lake",-1],[96,97,"i",-1],[98,102,"give",-1],[103,107,"them",-1],[108,112,"some",-1],[113,118,"bread",-1]]},{"t":"Some children fly kites. Some people walk their dogs. Some grandmas dance to music. Grandpa likes to sit on a bench and talk with his friends.","w":[[0,4,"some",-1],[5,13,"children",-1],[14,17,"fly",0],[18,23,"kites",0],[25,29,"some",-1],[30,36,"people",-1],[37,41,"walk",1],[42,47,"their",1],[48,52,"dogs",1],[54,58,"some",-1],[59,67,"grandmas",-1],[68,73,"dance",2],[74,76,"to",2],[77,82,"music",2],[84,91,"grandpa",-1],[92,97,"likes",-1],[98,100,"to",-1],[101,104,"sit",-1],[105,107,"on",-1],[108,109,"a",-1],[110,115,"bench",-1],[116,119,"and",-1],[120,124,"talk",-1],[125,129,"with",-1],[130,133,"his",-1],[134,141,"friends",-1]]},{"t":"I like the slide best. I go up and down, up and down. When the sun goes down, we walk home. \"See you tomorrow, park!\" I say.","w":[[0,1,"i",-1],[2,6,"like",-1],[7,10,"the",-1],[11,16,"slide",-1],[17,21,"best",-1],[23,24,"i",-1],[25,27,"go",-